A spinning 3D bar chart is a great fit for a rich widget — here's one built with pure CSS 3D transforms (no external libraries).

:::intelligent-ui-html{v="1"}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: dark light; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--viz-text, #e6e7ea);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 360px;
    perspective: 900px;
    perspective-origin: 50% 40%;
    user-select: none;
    touch-action: none;
    cursor: grab;
  }
  .stage:active { cursor: grabbing; }
  .world {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 55%;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transform: rotateX(-28deg) rotateY(25deg);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .ground {
    position: absolute;
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(-2px);
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(120,120,140,.35), transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .axis {
    position: absolute;
    background: var(--viz-border, rgba(255,255,255,.18));
  }
  .axis.x { width: 340px; height: 1px; transform: translate(-170px,0,-170px) rotateY(0deg); }
  .axis.z { width: 340px; height: 1px; transform: translate(-170px,0,-170px) rotateY(90deg); }
  .bars { position: absolute; transform-style: preserve-3d; }
  .bar {
    position: absolute;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    left: 0; top: 0;
  }
  .face {
    position: absolute;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    backface-visibility: hidden;
  }
  .lbl {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform-origin: top center;
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotateX(90deg) translateZ(4px);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--viz-muted, #9aa0a6);
    text-align: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  button {
    background: var(--viz-card, #2b2f36);
    color: var(--viz-text, #e6e7ea);
    border: 1px solid var(--viz-border, rgba(255,255,255,.15));
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:hover { background: var(--viz-accent, #4f8cff); color: #fff; border-color: transparent; }
  .hint {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--viz-muted, #9aa0a6);
    padding-bottom: 6px;
  }
</style>
</head>
